sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Popup as Popup Manager
    participant BG as Background SW
    participant CS as Content Script
    participant Page as Web Page
    
    User->>Popup: Click 'Activate' on filter card
    Popup->>BG: sendMessage({action: 'applyFilter', filter: 'grayscale'})
    BG->>CS: chrome.tabs.sendMessage (forward to tab)
    CS->>Page: Inject CSS filter & update DOM
    CS->>BG: Send success response
    BG->>Popup: Notify success
    Popup->>Popup: Update button state ('Active')
    Popup->>User: Show notification 'Filter applied'
